  "description": "declared HTML widgets in a shell's slots under addons.widgets of the shell, keyed by slot (D31): {\"<slot>\": {\"form\": {...}}}, {\"<slot>\": {\"table\": {...}}} or {\"<slot>\": {\"choices\": {}}}; the widget's id is its slot's (A6.1) | a form edits content fields and knobs: settings: true takes the experience's settings, items names inputs; apply confirm (default) or live; submit fires a trigger after each successful apply; readOnly shows values only | the experience's settings (groups and items, 5.3.2) under addons.widgets.settings of the experience | the shell's structure (the shell document, slots, hideSlots, open, close) is core (10.1, D31.2); custom widgets a host writes are a 2.1 draft",
